# claude code
# Both are already covered on this machine — settings.local.json by the global
# ignore, worktrees/ by .git/info/exclude — but neither of those travels with
# the repo. settings.local.json holds per-machine permission grants and
# worktrees/ holds full agent checkouts; neither belongs in a commit.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
